 998:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  and then returns the negation of the result.
 999:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *
1000:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  For example, given a vector of integers and a trivial predicate,
1001:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  \code
1002:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  struct IntGreaterThanThree
