1013:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  The not1/unary_negate combination works on predicates taking a single
1014:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  argument.  The not2/binary_negate combination works on predicates taking
